# 2. `.gitignore`

Kopiere das hier in deine `.gitignore`:

```gitignore
# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd

# Jupyter
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Virtual environments
venv/
.venv/
env/

# OS / Editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/

# Environment files
.env

# Data exports
data/raw/*.csv
data/processed/*.csv
reports/*.csv
reports/*.xlsx
reports/*.pdf

# Images / generated outputs
images/*.png
images/*.jpg
images/*.jpeg

# Temporary files
*.log
